#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:5
#: 0d9a510b80b64c01bcc61dbaf01a752e 5312d76888da421d819d7fbbdbd0176b
#: e30ccc1af4f44351b25830a4df3bdc65 e64edf077295488da4a1c3540f77a5ba
msgid "Loweheiser Generator"
msgstr "Loweheiser 发电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:9
#: 4080bc084a5b48caa9200f63f890a445 70c64e8d764647a3ac8a42bebf005b6e
#: 91fd9e4f5ce242c5903b40ee616002cc d86073f687114a768ba1ccf82082742c
msgid ""
"The `Loweheiser Hybgen <https://www.loweheiser.com/hybrid-drone-"
"generators/>`__ is an electric generator that can be installed into a "
"multirotor drone to extend the flight time. This hybrid powertrain is "
"suitable for drones up to 25 kg MTOM that require long flight times or heavy"
" payloads. It consists of a two-stroke combustion engine of 32cc with a "
"permanent-magnet generator attached to the crankshaft."
msgstr ""
"`Loweheiser Hybgen <https://www.loweheiser.com/hybrid-drone-generators/>`__ "
"是一款可装入多旋翼无人机以延长飞行时间的发电机。这套混合动力系统适用于最大起飞重量（MTOM）不超过 25 kg、需要长航时或大载荷的无人机。它由一台 "
"32cc 二冲程内燃机和安装在曲轴上的永磁发电机组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:12
#: 6ab00179b62b469ea77f726d27d270fb c5d881a65e7c4b71b9066d810acbf76e
#: d643c6fb68994f99af435fb8cc702d72 db3c2164fd8047a3830952983d94e621
msgid "Compilation"
msgstr "编译"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:14
#: 1072cbd521924db3b612365206e6b6c9 523b0e16845e48deb2eb8235b67b1355
#: 87959f7ee772460d8790a356ec12240f f0c2f6b93e404b3b8670c7c26af8fe81
msgid ""
"the driver for this device is not included by default in the firmware built "
"and available on the `Firmware Server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ . "
"Either the user must build his own firmware with this backend enabled or use"
" the `Custom Firmware Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"该设备的驱动程序默认不包含在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上构建和提供的固件中。用户必须自行构建启用此后端的固件，或使用 `自定义固件服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:19
#: 122b9ee26d09420abc0f627c84c0eb3c 16a0b210d49247b89b9a221b0cda9ae3
#: 2a36819fe8a74e65bff08af7646636c8 340850bd162c4ff68448c6f47b1debde
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:22
#: 422ab860e7f5481ca63a541c836e644a 4d1a39bc84aa4f0da937ea68a6d6cbec
#: 6b707c34850a4f988910493f2b942389 993776fca7d14ae8981b7e165ed7d677
msgid "Parameter configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:24
#: 01f0e39b0ca742a09e5b9beb28d851b0 55e06d25969a4e26aa16f8d3e29650b4
#: 6d27d41674934f6abf064afd1ec56cff 859508844eab4c2b83cd886d1bd31935
msgid ""
"This generator is a serial device. Connect it to a serial port of the flight"
" controller and set the corresponding ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=2`` (MAVLink). Also"
" set  the corresponding ``MAVx_OPTIONS`` bit 1 (Don’t forward mavlink "
"to/from)."
msgstr ""
"该发电机是一个串口设备。将其连接到飞控的某个串口，并设置对应的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL=2`` （MAVLink）。同时设置对应 "
"``MAVx_OPTIONS`` 的 bit 1（Don’t forward mavlink to/from，不转发 mavlink）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:26
#: 16a73ec65f60494689470fad5e9590c2 5bf6f5dba9be40a8927afdf1afdd5bc0
#: 8f7b904fd596492d9619cc299371d3bb 91540d1002a24d12b6e913c7aab9f0d8
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EFI_TYPE <EFI_TYPE>` = 4 (Loweheiser) and :ref:`GEN_TYPE "
"<GEN_TYPE>` = 4 (Loweheiser). Restart the flight controller to load the rest"
" of the generator and EFI parameters."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`EFI_TYPE <EFI_TYPE>` = 4（Loweheiser）和 :ref:`GEN_TYPE <GEN_TYPE>` = "
"4（Loweheiser）。重启飞控以加载其余的发电机和 EFI 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:29
#: 19a27ce6d3ff420c844c3e8a3c398651 38953642f80b432cbe7d4b1aafb34dda
#: 76ecc65650bd4aa79368d890f7eaa404 c9710cf7798f47c69de65511bbf1d840
msgid ""
"Configure a 3-position switch on an RC input channel with ``RCx_OPTION=85`` "
"(Generator). This will act as the generator state control switch."
msgstr "在一个 RC 输入通道上配置三段开关，设置 ``RCx_OPTION=85`` （Generator）。它将作为发电机状态控制开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:31
#: 1ab1900559b34609965b2abbeb4db7e8 1c0db37f8d544fb6bfcb0a7f29530b67
#: a7c6785c96cf4ab7990525dfa54a8575 bcd389a806144560a6f4f958801b4f37
msgid ""
"(OPTIONAL) Configure an analog RC input channel (not a switch) with "
"``RCy_OPTION=218`` (Loweheiser throttle). This will act as manual throttle "
"input for the generator throttle body. It is encouraged to use your throttle"
" stick to drive this input channel."
msgstr ""
"（可选）配置一个模拟量 RC 输入通道（而不是开关），设置 ``RCy_OPTION=218`` （Loweheiser "
"throttle）。它将作为发电机节气门的手动油门输入。建议用你的油门摇杆来驱动该输入通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:33
#: 4af8984bc03a48ec8f85ffdb80dd06a1 98b7d8d009ee4d6ab0f112d18c52062b
#: a9c5fff63ee54472a6ba344accf3b694 d28a1efd0e8541e4b59934e110ed8e12
msgid ""
"(OPTIONAL) Configure an switch-type RC input channel with ``RCz_OPTION=111``"
" (Loweheiser starter). This is a switch that will control the generator "
"starter."
msgstr ""
"（可选）配置一个开关型 RC 输入通道，设置 ``RCz_OPTION=111`` （Loweheiser "
"starter）。这个开关用于控制发电机的启动电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:35
#: 0551e20ac80e4166a72e646195fd3d2c 1c9c2c104e0341e7b1da4585c48054a8
#: 49020db607f24b88b41b645f93fe77e9 757b45cdd8fb477eb05eb132bd90a6fb
msgid ""
"There is no need to configure output channels, as the generator is operated "
"entirely through the serial port."
msgstr "无需配置输出通道，发电机完全通过串口操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:37
#: 0e847cc9964a452f83596cd01fe3b484 2903ffea804a4a24bac284f5b4126215
#: a066498a99b24f54b4b01cae621652fd fa9b26dca21b4109a03def7a3e9f3763
msgid ""
"To monitor the generator performance, configure a battery monitor with "
"``BATTx_TYPE=17`` (Generator-Elec). To monitor the engine performance, "
"configure a battery monitor with ``BATTy_TYPE=18`` (Generator-Fuel). Set the"
" volume of the fuel in the tank in ``BATTy_CAPACITY`` (in mL)."
msgstr ""
"要监控发电机的发电性能，配置一个电池监测，``BATTx_TYPE=17`` （Generator-"
"Elec）。要监控发动机性能，配置一个电池监测，``BATTy_TYPE=18`` （Generator-Fuel）。在 "
"``BATTy_CAPACITY`` 中设置油箱的燃油容量（单位 mL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:39
#: 07c7984eb59c42a7925f3f71470cce2c 6140ee67fc784136a01ca58fb127e839
#: 824da0c8f2764eaa89cd076f0d3f78ca cd117038e6d848a39c02847eb77094bd
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TH <GEN_L_IDLE_TH>` can be used to adjust the throttle "
"percent that will be sent to the generator throttle body during idling."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TH <GEN_L_IDLE_TH>` 可用于调整怠速期间发送给发电机节气门的油门百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:41
#: 195e9e8d27a843029dd30045ffc5b599 b59b287d02d644c8ab9e58f6ba8cb60f
#: e5bc48fd12b74130b9bb65e80718a5ec f1794fd3d9874bb0b1b9f5b11dffecb1
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TH_H <GEN_L_IDLE_TH_H>` can be used to adjust the throttle "
"percent that will be sent to the generator throttle body, during warming up "
"or cooldown."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TH_H <GEN_L_IDLE_TH_H>` 可用于调整暖机或冷却期间发送给发电机节气门的油门百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:43
#: 3f36ad86dc93463eb1e873cc4e3b6412 5c7052ad7b2149709321e837730da0a5
#: 704784bef14b4c1ca3495759ab751d45 cf0e857d15c1410e968c33e7607efe60
msgid ""
"The following parameters can be used to adjust the temperature limits of the"
" generator:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整发电机的温度限值："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:45
#: 3b00161405014dbe9412a12cb166a84c 3c0d1bf7a8b848198dee15c93662460c
#: d41a7d48505846779734dbe7a3afc086 f5d06d8cdfcd47ecb0d828c16627b0f9
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_RUN_TEMP <GEN_L_RUN_TEMP>`: The cylinder head temperature "
"required for the generator to start producing power, in deg Celsius."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_RUN_TEMP <GEN_L_RUN_TEMP>`：发电机开始发电所需的缸头温度，单位摄氏度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:46
#: 03b423c2160d4c5e990cc52d7a57f651 3ebd8297c7144273a67ce39c8e08cab7
#: 87d82f6235aa42dfba09043375baaeb7 ca7ef5507b0a46c78463324aa05f38f2
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TEMP <GEN_L_IDLE_TEMP>`: The cylinder head temperature "
"required for the generator to return to idle after having run."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_IDLE_TEMP <GEN_L_IDLE_TEMP>`：发电机运转之后回到怠速所需的缸头温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:47
#: 33d3269cec514004a18f666f2c57ae82 3526d7c07f9542e8a7c513ffcccd8857
#: 80f72d55a7504555959cca5f92969958 ddf49f34c1bd490fa0218e449469bc00
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_OVER_TEMP <GEN_L_OVER_TEMP>`: The cylinder head overheat "
"temperature. Above this threshold a warning message gets sent over MAVLink"
msgstr ""
":ref:`GEN_L_OVER_TEMP <GEN_L_OVER_TEMP>`：缸头过热温度。超过该阈值会通过 MAVLink 发送警告消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:49
#: 3e77c24a8b6742729ad69c667787202e 58267371940e45be8d7441118d3cb3ee
#: 97a5e22aca874f4883f24b15d35f2bb8 f66eb1c8fe5f40938c528a6e32fd4bf3
msgid ""
"The following parameters are not yet supported by the generator "
"manufacturer:"
msgstr "发电机制造商尚不支持以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:51
#: 115dd159f15e43eabf36f3859b225498 79417a02664548c1ba424fb6d8b6316e
#: 9fc3ecfcfb744e8c8b2caf628e882335 ea4506e7faa745f5a9022d65975bfbca
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_MNT_TIME <GEN_L_MNT_TIME>`: Seconds until maintenance is "
"required."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_MNT_TIME <GEN_L_MNT_TIME>`：距离需要保养的秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:52
#: 3c6a89d628204a3ab77fbfad1211a150 6909448eeda14180bc54cc75db40a5ce
#: d2903d1a8d6249e38c2f8ba797f5d1b6 e1b921008f8a4d229502a2f9f14634ff
msgid ""
":ref:`GEN_L_RUNTIME <GEN_L_RUNTIME>`: Total time this generator has run, in "
"seconds."
msgstr ":ref:`GEN_L_RUNTIME <GEN_L_RUNTIME>`：该发电机的累计运转时间，单位秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:55
#: 4ba10f68cbae41fd9a1d763beeae29c5 5f7f72f78d09432bb8a19f3b4df0a29a
#: d0637d3bc5d9418eba94ae1840d74149 ec43ede1b4f543568fa724d663b66681
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "操控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:57
#: 2e7b94537b3b4be99277630ea276920b 90e9337b9f134d70b659789a145faded
#: 9743ca1a3c0749c1b03f85b81283d597 fbab77dc158a47809b64a5251d16dbfa
msgid ""
"The switch configured as Generator has 3 values: STOP, IDLE, RUNNING. Begin "
"on the STOP command. The generator is stopped."
msgstr "配置为 Generator 的开关有 3 个档位：STOP、IDLE、RUNNING。从 STOP 档开始，此时发电机处于停止状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:59
#: 1a5f38755d1d494e9d44ee80fa4af59e 6e60ffe244f448acb0cc693b433da4ec
#: 7300c21d57b74a4e8bdeb18cc9abb248 ebed47971a8e40c68fcf841bd967c420
msgid ""
"Set the generator switch to IDLE. The goal of the IDLE state is to start the"
" engine and bring it up to temperature. If you have configured a Loweheiser "
"throttle input channel, you can now use it to select the throttle during "
"IDLE state. Otherwise, ``GEN_IDLE_TH`` will be applied. If you have "
"configured a Loweheiser starter input channel, you can now use it to "
"activate the starter motor and crank the engine. Otherwise, crank the engine"
" manually."
msgstr ""
"将发电机开关置于 IDLE。IDLE 状态的目的是启动发动机并使其升温。如果已配置 Loweheiser 油门输入通道，现在可以用它来选择 IDLE "
"状态下的油门；否则将采用 ``GEN_IDLE_TH``。如果已配置 Loweheiser "
"启动器输入通道，现在可以用它来接通启动电机并启动发动机；否则请手动启动发动机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:63
#: 5fe00c3538fe4801a4d7b1fb2aa2f65d b143009d9fab4496ab73edc3be72f41d
#: f505de80c2414ff2a46167d468e9567a ff664d302b6c4725b0e6892be3e714f8
msgid ""
"Set the generator switch to RUNNING. The driver will actually wait until the"
" engine reaches a temperature of ``GEN_RUN_TEMP``, before it switches to the"
" RUN state. Until then, it will set the throttle to ``GEN_IDLE_TH_H``."
msgstr ""
"将发电机开关置于 RUNNING。驱动实际上会等到发动机温度达到 ``GEN_RUN_TEMP`` 后才切换到 RUN 状态。在此之前，它会把油门设为 "
"``GEN_IDLE_TH_H``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:65
#: 565a5ed01c9d40e1a61bbd02c4c9bed3 6de247c79a444773ad25ac3ea4508e1d
#: ae9e13c46ab347a1b1e12d2d5cf52efa df322fd9b1ee4959a8e6cfcc4165039a
msgid ""
"Once temperature is reached, the generator will proceed to the RUN state. In"
" this state the throttle is controlled automatically by a governor and the "
"generator produces power."
msgstr "温度达到后，发电机进入 RUN 状态。在该状态下油门由调速器自动控制，发电机开始发电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:67
#: 32ba2d248349452cae9f70e13c60c698 6d484d4488ff4f138f129ec71d12c119
#: d489d922afbe4dd0b06d9bcfaf3b4462 eec78058f91c4ebcb87141abefaa2537
msgid ""
"To stop the engine, set the Generator switch to STOP. The driver will "
"actually wait until the engine cools down to a temperature of "
"``GEN_IDLE_TEMP`` before it stops. During that time, it will apply "
"``GEN_IDLE_TH_H`` throttle."
msgstr ""
"要停止发动机，将 Generator 开关置于 STOP。驱动实际上会等到发动机冷却至 ``GEN_IDLE_TEMP`` "
"温度后才停机。在此期间，它会施加 ``GEN_IDLE_TH_H`` 的油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:69
#: 201312dcba6b4034b9c691426a3eb4c4 9d0a4045cf9f4a7283d663684a72fa79
#: a238afb4aa7f4298bb91b69aa9e5e974 d3964e5be24542048168418056b8fc40
msgid "No state transitions will take place once the vehicle is armed."
msgstr "载具解锁后将不再发生任何状态转换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:71
#: 037a2143bf0444b3a8d6d342f3181dce 1a8ea6c5a6eb4828b3546dec599cc298
#: 75c935b08abd4468a563459ab0c8357c effe49178de04581b5bd89d15bcee125
msgid ""
"The Loweheiser driver will apply additional pre-arm checks, to ensure safety"
" of operations."
msgstr "Loweheiser 驱动会执行额外的解锁前检查，以确保操作安全。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:74
#: 5615e88a485e41879b953bda1595ead5 5e124971af444325b5be996d9c028819
#: e14137a2e6b64064a2807880cbc9b002 e655cb87178f41febe012a7ca737c281
msgid "MAVLink messages"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:76
#: 062e925fc7bd46e495bc429d838cf965 12d6c71c810e442eacc2bade7e23defd
#: 1af5a8399d7c47d79be7a3a55c66e8bf f1d003d6fbc5454088e1ce0df8f59d64
msgid "The generator will emit the following MAVLink telemetry messages:"
msgstr "发电机会发出以下 MAVLink 数传消息："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:78
#: 0e877422ef244728bfa410cd29b0a93c 9bca8f6cf43a45e1a7aa53b54edea35d
#: cf7fb8bae59049bc9867479651a2eac8 deabcecec7fb4ca28f94e03600dfba06
msgid "``GENERATOR_STATUS``"
msgstr "``GENERATOR_STATUS``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:79
#: 1ad3d8e022fc45c6a264f32a476193ab 72986fd203fa4b21a730b64d6e65bf73
#: b1ebd1bd387747e4a985b82ac90297f4 e27faad69c4c4447bb0545066d5ef7f8
msgid "``EFI_STATUS``"
msgstr "``EFI_STATUS``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:82
#: 037d2bd0ffde482caf0c7fae54933453 2ddf92a4eaba4a6b8bc0c8a6b4aa96f6
#: 3f675188016843ceb81412127f52adcf d51cf9f73d3a482781014dad297c5f34
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:84
#: 69b6071bb8134e08a725ae1ef4b49c5a 78e5c26cb0fe4624b999b3942e77e9b3
#: bb6823a405c348d2b5153c886983bc91 d4ca44329155462aa271e72f81c90d06
msgid "This driver will add the following messages to the onboard log:"
msgstr "此驱动会向机载日志中添加以下消息："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:86
#: 6c4dd4f7b4d141588ca75e22b10b195c 8432ec305db7407b8b7dc55c9c494df5
#: c22f28149a074f56a020da7cf6a20017 ce6d919bc3ea4128a812ad84905680bb
msgid "``LOEC``: Debug information for the driver state machine."
msgstr "``LOEC``：驱动状态机的调试信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loweheiser-generator.rst:87
#: 0686bf263d554a6f80e6b49120cc7ead 6985c8db40af4cd1a661ae0c064520b3
#: a4aaea023922499d8f31c92c67cf7a14 ff6d9ac2d46d4b758c19ff8ac54d569a
msgid "``LOEG``: Generator telemetry."
msgstr "``LOEG``：发电机数传数据。"
